msgstr "動力学行列へのバブル補正を行いません"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:654
msgid "Calculate bubble correction on top of the SCPH dynamical matrix"
msgstr "SCPH 動力学行列に加えてバブル補正を計算します"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:665
msgid "RELAX_STR-tag = 0 | 1 | 2 | 3"
msgstr "RELAX_STR タグ = 0 | 1 | 2 | 3"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:668
msgid "Don't relax the crystal structure (not supported when ``MODE = QHA``)."
msgstr "結晶構造を緩和しません (``MODE = QHA`` のときはサポートされません)。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:669
#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:710
