"Compute the coherent component of thermal conductivity and save it in "
"``PREFIX``.kl_coherent."
msgstr "熱伝導率のコヒーレント成分を計算し、``PREFIX``.kl_coherent に保存します。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst
