"Compute the thermal conductivity spectra, which will be stored in  "
"``PREFIX``.kl_spec"
msgstr "熱伝導率スペクトルを計算し、``PREFIX``.kl_spec に保存します"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1863
msgid "This flag is available when ``MODE = kappa``."
msgstr "このフラグは ``MODE = kappa`` のときに利用可能です。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1870
msgid "ISOTOPE-tag = 0 | 1 | 2"
msgstr "ISOTOPE タグ = 0 | 1 | 2"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1873
msgid "Do not consider phonon-isotope scatterings"
msgstr "フォノン-同位体散乱を考慮しません"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1874
msgid "Consider phonon-isotope scatterings"
msgstr "フォノン-同位体散乱を考慮します"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst
msgid "Consider phonon-isotope scatterings as in ``ISOTOPE = 1`` and"
msgstr "``ISOTOPE = 1`` と同様にフォノン-同位体散乱を考慮し、"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst
msgid "the calculated selfenergy is stored in ``PREFIX``.self_isotope"
msgstr "計算された自己エネルギーが ``PREFIX``.self_isotope に保存されます"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1881
msgid ""
"When ``MODE = kappa`` and ``ISOTOPE = 1 or 2``, phonon scatterings due to "
"isotopes will be considered perturbatively. The computation is negligibly "
"cheap, so it is enabled by default with ``ISOFACT`` taken from the internal "
"natural-abundance database; set ``ISOTOPE = 0`` for isotopically pure "
"crystals, or give ``ISOFACT`` explicitly for enriched samples (required for "
"elements without a database entry). The per-mode isotope linewidths and the "
"factors used are stored in ``PREFIX``.kappa.h5 "
"(``/scattering/isotope/gamma``, ``/metadata/isotope_factors``)."
msgstr ""
"``MODE = kappa`` かつ ``ISOTOPE = 1 または 2`` "
"のとき、同位体によるフォノン散乱が摂動論的に考慮されます。計算コストは無視できるほど小さいため、内部の天然存在比データベースから ``ISOFACT``"
" を取得して既定で有効になっています。同位体的に純粋な結晶では ``ISOTOPE = 0`` を設定し、濃縮試料では ``ISOFACT`` "
"を明示的に指定してください (データベースにない元素では必須です)。モードごとの同位体線幅と使用された係数は ``PREFIX``.kappa.h5 "
"に保存されます (``/scattering/isotope/gamma``、``/metadata/isotope_factors``)。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1893
msgid ""
"ISOFACT-tag : Isotope factor for each atomic species (in the order of the "
"``KD``-tag)"
msgstr "ISOFACT タグ : 各原子種に対する同位体因子 (``KD`` タグの順序で)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1895
msgid "Automatically calculated from the ``KD`` tag"
msgstr "``KD`` タグから自動的に計算されます"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1897
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Isotope factor is a dimensionless value defined by :math:`\\sum_{i} f_{i} (1"
" - m_{i}/\\bar{m})^{2}`. Here, :math:`f_{i}` is the fraction of the "
":math:`i`\\ th isotope of an element having mass :math:`m_{i}`, and "
":math:`\\bar{m}=\\sum_{i}f_{i}m_{i}` is the average mass, respectively. This"
" quantity is equivalent to :math:`g_{2}` appearing in the original paper by "
"S. Tamura [Phys. Rev. B, 27, 858.]."
msgstr ""
"同位体因子は :math:`\\sum_{i} f_{i} (1 - m_{i}/\\bar{m})^{2}` "
"で定義される無次元量です。ここで、:math:`f_{i}` は質量 :math:`m_{i}` を持つ元素の :math:`i`\\ "
"番目の同位体の存在比率であり、:math:`\\bar{m}=\\sum_{i}f_{i}m_{i}` は平均質量です。この量は、S. Tamura "
"による原論文 [Phys. Rev. B, 27, 858.] に現れる :math:`g_{2}` に等しいものです。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1907
msgid "ISOTOPE_INSCATTERING-tag = 0 | 1"
msgstr "ISOTOPE_INSCATTERING タグ = 0 | 1"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1910
msgid ""
"Isotope scattering enters the iterative solvers as an RTA-level (diagonal) "
"rate only"
msgstr "同位体散乱は反復ソルバーに RTA レベルの (対角) レートとしてのみ入ります"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1912
msgid ""
"The elastic isotope-disorder channel (Tamura kernel) becomes part of the "
"collision operator, including its in-scattering term"
msgstr ""
"弾性的な同位体無秩序チャネル (Tamura カーネル) が、流入散乱 (in-scattering) 項を含めて衝突演算子の一部になります"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1918
msgid ""
"Used by ``SOLVER = IBTE`` and ``VBTE`` when ``ISOTOPE >= 1`` (``SOLVER = "
"RTA`` is unaffected). With the in-scattering term the isotope diagonal is "
"the row sum of the operator entries, so the elastic channel annihilates "
"constant deviation functions exactly. The effect on kappa is positive (in-"
"scattering restores heat flux) and grows with the mass variance and towards "
"low temperatures; for natural silicon it is below 0.2 %. Boundary scattering"
" remains exactly diagonal (it has no in-scattering term), and the four-"
"phonon channel is treated at the RTA level."
msgstr ""
"``ISOTOPE >= 1`` のときに ``SOLVER = IBTE`` および ``VBTE`` で使用されます (``SOLVER = "
"RTA`` "
"には影響しません)。流入散乱項を含める場合、同位体の対角成分は演算子成分の行和となるため、弾性チャネルは定数の偏差関数を厳密に消滅させます。熱伝導率への効果は正であり"
" (流入散乱は熱流を回復させます)、質量分散が大きいほど、また低温ほど大きくなります。天然ケイ素では 0.2 % "
"未満です。境界散乱は厳密に対角のままであり (流入散乱項を持ちません)、4 フォノンチャネルは RTA レベルで扱われます。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1932
msgid ""
"LEN_BOUNDARY-tag : Characteristic length for boundary scattering in units of"
" meter"
msgstr "LEN_BOUNDARY タグ : 境界散乱の特徴長さ (単位: メートル)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1934
msgid "0.0 (no boundary scattering)"
msgstr "0.0 (境界散乱なし)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1936
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"When ``LEN_BOUNDARY > 0``, a boundary scattering rate "
":math:`|\\boldsymbol{v}_{qj}|/L` with :math:`L` = ``LEN_BOUNDARY`` is added "
"to the phonon linewidths used for the thermal conductivity, where "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{v}_{qj}` is the group velocity of each phonon mode."
msgstr ""
"``LEN_BOUNDARY > 0`` のとき、境界散乱レート :math:`|\\boldsymbol{v}_{qj}|/L` (:math:`L`"
" = ``LEN_BOUNDARY``) が熱伝導率に使用されるフォノン線幅に追加されます。ここで "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{v}_{qj}` は各フォノンモードの群速度です。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1942
msgid "ITERATIVE-tag = 0 | 1"
msgstr "ITERATIVE タグ = 0 | 1"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1945
msgid "Solve the BTE within the relaxation-time approximation (RTA)"
msgstr "緩和時間近似 (RTA) の範囲で BTE を解きます"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1946
msgid "Solve the linearized BTE iteratively (beyond the RTA)"
msgstr "線形化 BTE を反復的に解きます (RTA を超えた計算)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1951
msgid ""
"Deprecated alias of :ref:`SOLVER <anphon_solver>` = IBTE (a warning is "
"printed; ``SOLVER`` wins when both are given). When enabled, the linearized "
"phonon Boltzmann transport equation is solved self-consistently by iteration"
" instead of the RTA, and the resulting lattice thermal conductivity is "
"written to ``PREFIX``.kl_iter. The iteration is controlled by "
":ref:`MIN_CYCLE <anphon_min_cycle>`, :ref:`MAX_CYCLE <anphon_max_cycle>`, "
":ref:`ITER_THRESHOLD <anphon_iter_threshold>`, and :ref:`IBTE_MIXING "
"<anphon_ibte_mixing>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SOLVER <anphon_solver>` = IBTE の非推奨のエイリアスです (警告が表示されます。両方が指定された場合は "
"``SOLVER`` が優先されます)。有効にすると、線形化フォノンボルツマン輸送方程式が RTA "
"の代わりに反復によって自己無撞着に解かれ、得られた格子熱伝導率が ``PREFIX``.kl_iter に書き出されます。反復は "
":ref:`MIN_CYCLE <anphon_min_cycle>`、:ref:`MAX_CYCLE "
"<anphon_max_cycle>`、:ref:`ITER_THRESHOLD "
"<anphon_iter_threshold>`、:ref:`IBTE_MIXING <anphon_ibte_mixing>` で制御します。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1957
msgid ""
"MIN_CYCLE-tag : Minimum number of iterations of the iterative BTE solver"
msgstr "MIN_CYCLE タグ : 反復 BTE ソルバーの最小反復回数"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1959
msgid "5"
msgstr "5"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1961
msgid ""
"Used when ``ITERATIVE = 1``. The convergence test starts only after "
"``MIN_CYCLE`` iterations have been performed."
msgstr ""
"``ITERATIVE = 1`` のときに使用されます。収束判定は ``MIN_CYCLE`` 回の反復が実行された後にのみ開始されます。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1967
msgid ""
"MAX_CYCLE-tag : Maximum number of iterations of the iterative BTE solver"
msgstr "MAX_CYCLE タグ : 反復 BTE ソルバーの最大反復回数"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1971
msgid ""
"Used when ``ITERATIVE = 1``. If the iteration does not converge within "
"``MAX_CYCLE`` cycles, the last value of the thermal conductivity is kept and"
" the calculation proceeds to the next temperature."
msgstr ""
"``ITERATIVE = 1`` のときに使用されます。``MAX_CYCLE`` "
"回以内に反復が収束しない場合、熱伝導率の最後の値が保持され、計算は次の温度へ進みます。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1977
msgid "ITER_THRESHOLD-tag : Convergence criterion of the iterative BTE solver"
msgstr "ITER_THRESHOLD タグ : 反復 BTE ソルバーの収束基準"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1979
msgid "0.02"
msgstr "0.02"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1981
msgid ""
"Used when ``ITERATIVE = 1``. The iteration at each temperature stops when "
"the relative change of every diagonal component of the thermal conductivity "
"tensor between two successive iterations becomes smaller than "
"``ITER_THRESHOLD``."
msgstr ""
"``ITERATIVE = 1`` のときに使用されます。各温度での反復は、連続する 2 回の反復間で熱伝導率テンソルのすべての対角成分の相対変化が "
"``ITER_THRESHOLD`` より小さくなったときに停止します。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1987
msgid "IBTE_MIXING-tag : Mixing factor of the iterative BTE solver"
msgstr "IBTE_MIXING タグ : 反復 BTE ソルバーの混合係数"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1989
msgid "0.9"
msgstr "0.9"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1991
msgid ""
"Used when ``ITERATIVE = 1``. In each iteration, the updated nonequilibrium "
"distribution is mixed with the previous one as :math:`f_{\\mathrm{new}} "
"\\leftarrow \\alpha f_{\\mathrm{new}} + (1-\\alpha) f_{\\mathrm{old}}` with "
":math:`\\alpha` = ``IBTE_MIXING``. Values smaller than 1 damp oscillations "
"of slowly converging iterations."
msgstr ""
"``ITERATIVE = 1`` のときに使用されます。各反復で、更新された非平衡分布は :math:`f_{\\mathrm{new}} "
"\\leftarrow \\alpha f_{\\mathrm{new}} + (1-\\alpha) f_{\\mathrm{old}}` "
"(:math:`\\alpha` = ``IBTE_MIXING``) のように前回の分布と混合されます。1 "
"より小さい値は、収束の遅い反復の振動を抑えます。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:1998
msgid "Format of BORNINFO"
msgstr "BORNINFO の書式"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:2000
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"When one wants to consider the LO-TO splitting near the :math:`\\Gamma` "
"point, it is necessary to set ``NONANALYTIC > 0`` and provide ``BORNINFO`` "
"file containing dielectric tensor :math:`\\epsilon^{\\infty}` and Born "
"effective charge :math:`Z^{*}`. In ``BORNINFO`` file, the dielectric tensor "
"should be written in first 3 lines which are followed by Born effective "
"charge tensors for each atom as the following."
msgstr ""
":math:`\\Gamma` 点近傍の LO-TO 分裂を考慮したい場合、``NONANALYTIC > 0`` を設定し、誘電テンソル "
":math:`\\epsilon^{\\infty}` と Born 有効電荷 :math:`Z^{*}` を含む ``BORNINFO`` "
"ファイルを用意する必要があります。``BORNINFO`` ファイルでは、最初の 3 行に誘電テンソルを記述し、その後に各原子の Born "
"有効電荷テンソルを以下のように記述します。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:2005
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{eqnarray*}\n"
" \\epsilon_{xx}^{\\infty} & \\epsilon_{xy}^{\\infty} & \\epsilon_{xz}^{\\infty} \\\\\n"
" \\epsilon_{yx}^{\\infty} & \\epsilon_{yy}^{\\infty} & \\epsilon_{yz}^{\\infty} \\\\\n"
" \\epsilon_{zx}^{\\infty} & \\epsilon_{zy}^{\\infty} & \\epsilon_{zz}^{\\infty} \\\\\n"
" Z_{1,xx}^{*} & Z_{1,xy}^{*} & Z_{1,xz}^{*} \\\\\n"
" Z_{1,yx}^{*} & Z_{1,yy}^{*} & Z_{1,zz}^{*} \\\\\n"
" Z_{1,zx}^{*} & Z_{1,zy}^{*} & Z_{1,zz}^{*} \\\\\n"
" & \\vdots & \\\\\n"
" Z_{N_p,xx}^{*} & Z_{N_p,xy}^{*} & Z_{N_p,xz}^{*} \\\\\n"
" Z_{N_p,yx}^{*} & Z_{N_p,yy}^{*} & Z_{N_p,zz}^{*} \\\\\n"
" Z_{N_p,zx}^{*} & Z_{N_p,zy}^{*} & Z_{N_p,zz}^{*} \\\\\n"
"\\end{eqnarray*}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{eqnarray*}\n"
" \\epsilon_{xx}^{\\infty} & \\epsilon_{xy}^{\\infty} & \\epsilon_{xz}^{\\infty} \\\\\n"
" \\epsilon_{yx}^{\\infty} & \\epsilon_{yy}^{\\infty} & \\epsilon_{yz}^{\\infty} \\\\\n"
" \\epsilon_{zx}^{\\infty} & \\epsilon_{zy}^{\\infty} & \\epsilon_{zz}^{\\infty} \\\\\n"
" Z_{1,xx}^{*} & Z_{1,xy}^{*} & Z_{1,xz}^{*} \\\\\n"
" Z_{1,yx}^{*} & Z_{1,yy}^{*} & Z_{1,zz}^{*} \\\\\n"
" Z_{1,zx}^{*} & Z_{1,zy}^{*} & Z_{1,zz}^{*} \\\\\n"
" & \\vdots & \\\\\n"
" Z_{N_p,xx}^{*} & Z_{N_p,xy}^{*} & Z_{N_p,xz}^{*} \\\\\n"
" Z_{N_p,yx}^{*} & Z_{N_p,yy}^{*} & Z_{N_p,zz}^{*} \\\\\n"
" Z_{N_p,zx}^{*} & Z_{N_p,zy}^{*} & Z_{N_p,zz}^{*} \\\\\n"
"\\end{eqnarray*}"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:2021
msgid ""
"Here, :math:`N_p` is the number of atoms contained in the *primitive cell*."
msgstr "ここで、:math:`N_p` は *基本セル* に含まれる原子数です。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/inputanphon.rst:2025
msgid "Please pay attention to the order of Born effective charges."
msgstr "Born 有効電荷の順序に注意してください。"

